This website will serve as an official online website of the Holy Angel University Table 
Tennis Club, providing visitors or students a clear view of the team’s identity, coaches and 
values. It is aimed at building confidence in the club, and guiding students to have a 
background about us by showing the coach’s credentials and the team’s culture of oneness 
and excellence. Most importantly, it simplifies the try-out application process, guiding 
interested students through the requirements and enabling them to apply for trials from any 
page on the site. 
